  "description": "The VersaTul Data MsSql project provides the ability to quickly create database access objects, usable on Microsoft SQL Server databases. This project is built on top of a combination of System.Data.Common and System.Data.SqlClient namespaces. These are used to provide the functionality to quickly call stored procedures or plain text sql queries, and map the result into data objects using the provided helper methods. The project also provides MsSql Bulk Copy functionality, which can be use to bulk insert data into a MsSQL Server databases.",
